  <text x="645" y="360" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#333333" text-anchor="middle">• No firing below I_rheo</text>
  <text x="645" y="375" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#333333" text-anchor="middle">• Sudden onset at threshold</text>
